  "remainingArtPriorities": [
    "Architectural grouping and rhythm within the existing families would have greater impact than increasing window colour randomness. Preserve canonical shell boundaries, scale and source height.",
    "The large courtyard roof needs restrained, family-appropriate surface/edge and equipment composition if the SimCity 2013 target is held literally; avoid solving it with a high-contrast repeated texture.",
    "Ground and vegetation are now more coherent, but the overall scene still looks more like a clean city visualization than a fully authored commercial city-builder environment."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "This review does not declare equivalence to SimCity 2013 or close the overall artistic gate.",
    "All captures are daytime paused scenes. Night lighting, dynamic actor movement, GPU pose agreement, 30 FPS and WebGL/fault/camera sweeps are separate checks.",
    "390x844 is a responsive browser viewport, not a real mobile-device hardware performance result.",
    "The seven-district static review and ground evidence remain separate earlier artifacts; this run refreshes KAL and MET plus the three requested controls.",
    "PNG artifacts remain local. This portable document stores filenames and hashes only."
  ]
